  "title": "Oatmeal Strawberry Bread",
  "description": "This strawberry oat bread recipe makes 2 loaves filled with wonderful cinnamon and berry flavor. Keep one for yourself and gift the other to a friend!",
  "authors": [
    "Kat"
  ],
